# The effects last until end of turn and concern "your graveyard". Turn one: two Lightning Bolts go to Bot1's graveyard. Turn two: Bot2 casts
# a Mother of Runes. Turn three: Bot1 casts the Will, then one Bolt from the graveyard at the Mother: the Bolt is exiled instead of going to
# the graveyard, while the Mother (Bot2's card, Bot2's graveyard) is not exiled. The second Bolt stays in the graveyard, castable that turn
# (not cast); on turn five the permission is gone and it is refused (even with a Mox Ruby untapped).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Yawgmoth's Will
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mother of Runes
Plains x12

